{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/d7bbe1380d8717d984c291f033bad024.avif?t=1759395072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras_big/d7bbe1380d8717d984c291f033bad024.avif?t=1759395072 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c494e1cafc9779ad40cc6d9a719715d.poster.avif?t=1759395072\" width=616 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c494e1cafc9779ad40cc6d9a719715d.webm?t=1759395072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/7c494e1cafc9779ad40cc6d9a719715d.mp4?t=1759395072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a Witch-filled 3D Platforming adventure! Harness the power of your broom to fly, skate and <strong>BASH</strong> through dangerous, magical environments (and gain the adoration of your crush!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras/cd8ecc37287e6683f9f6b4f990313281.avif?t=1759395072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017130/extras_big/cd8ecc37287e6683f9f6b4f990313281.avif?t=1759395072 width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four witches with clashing personalities, all trying to find love within complicated stages of\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0their lives</p><p cla